SUMMARY:Garden Workday (Monroe)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Union County Wildlife chapter for a garden workday at the Union County Agricultural Center pollinator pitstop. We’ll be weeding\, watering\, and planting additional native plants in this site created by the Union County Habitat Stewards Training in October 2025. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/garden-workday/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/UCWCgardenworkday.jpg
END:VEVENT
