SUMMARY:Spring Bass Lake Garden Workday (Holly Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter for a hands-on maintenance and planting day at Bass Lake Park. We will kick off the afternoon with garden spring cleaning by weeding and tidying up our demonstration shade garden. After that\, we’ll roll up our sleeves to plant new pollinator plants and shrubs that will support local wildlife. Come prepared to get dirty! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/spring-bass-lake-garden-workday-holly-springs/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
